WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
The two were the people in the other tree that day

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:04,760
That woman doesn't seem to be the one who did it, so I don't care about her.

3
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,920
Anyway, it's in our hands.

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,080
How will Sister Li handle it?

5
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:16,940
Killing is still fun

6
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,330
What to do next

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,340
Steal into the small room at the back

8
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,300
Binding is the point

9
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,380
Don't let them get away

10
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:35,630
Junior One, Junior Two, look at it and talk about it

11
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:40,830
Is there anyone else besides these two? No, it’s just the two of them. We keep a close eye on them.

12
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:42,110
Make sure no third person is following you

13
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:45,550
There should be six or seven people in that other tree.

14
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:47,990
There were at least three people who drove back that night

15
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:49,710
Plus these two today

16
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,510
And the woman who killed Li Jianping

17
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,870
I guess there aren't many of them.

18
00:00:53,870 --> 00:00:55,190
Can fight less

19
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:57,630
Otherwise, there wouldn’t be two pathfinders here today.

20
00:00:57,630 --> 00:00:58,710
Instead, he called directly at the door.
